1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:05,000
SPECIMEN 7 · MEMORY
Before faces, there was a rhythm.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:11,000
DR. HANA PETROV
Four taps. Then we begin.

3
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,500
DR. HANA PETROV
You remembered.

4
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:22,000
DR. VALE
It anticipated a stimulus.

5
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:26,800
DR. HANA PETROV
It knew I was here.

6
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:33,000
SPECIMEN 7 · MEMORY
Two places. The same remembering.

7
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:37,400
MAINTENANCE WORKER
That wasn't me.

8
00:00:37,400 --> 00:00:39,000
DR. HANA PETROV
End contact.

9
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:44,000
SPECIMEN 7 · MEMORY
A hand that wasn't mine. A heart that was.

10
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,000
DR. HANA PETROV
Seven. Stay with the rhythm.

11
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:56,500
DR. HANA PETROV
Who released the interlock?

12
00:00:56,500 --> 00:00:59,000
SPECIMEN 7 · MEMORY
Then the wall stopped.

13
00:01:07,600 --> 00:01:15,200
SPECIMEN 7 · MEMORY
Outside, nobody knew the rhythm.

14
00:01:15,200 --> 00:01:20,000
SPECIMEN 7 · MEMORY
I could make the next beat.
